  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "BA140F3BD444D382",
      "text": "小生是八朔，請多指教是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "BA140E3BD444D1CF",
      "text": "感謝大家對上一堂\\n太晶化課程的好評。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "BA140D3BD444D01C",
      "text": "凰檗老師也希望這堂課能\\n給同學們帶來更多的對戰知識！\\r\\n……這是她親自拜託小生的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "BA140C3BD444CE69",
      "text": "因此，美術老師八朔我，\\n今天也要繼續講太晶化的事囉。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_03_poke_01",
      "hash64": "71F13B9D9AB60AA8",
      "text": "圓圓嚕。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "BA140B3BD444CCB6",
      "text": "當然，圓陸鯊前輩也在。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "BA140A3BD444CB03",
      "text": "圓陸鯊前輩，請太晶化！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_03_poke_02",
      "hash64": "71F13E9D9AB60FC1",
      "text": "圓噠～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "BA14093BD444C950",
      "text": "哎呀？\\n上次是草屬性的太晶，\\r\\n但這次形狀不同了是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "BA14183BD444E2CD",
      "text": "這太晶寶石看起來就像是雪花，\\n樹枝狀的造型真是美啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "BA14173BD444E11A",
      "text": "靠近時可以感受到\\n涼涼的寒氣呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "BA108A3BD441BBAC",
      "text": "來，請問這是什麼太晶屬性呢？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF4EF8FB6A22943B",
      "text": "水屬性",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF4EF9FB6A2295EE",
      "text": "冰屬性",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "CF4EFAFB6A2297A1",
      "text": "幽靈屬性",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "769515401675C2CB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，真可惜！\\n這是水改變狀態後的屬性喔。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_02",
      "hash64": "769516401675C47E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學！\\n一百分滿分！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_answer_03",
      "hash64": "769517401675C631",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，真可惜！\\n的確都會讓人涼涼的是也！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "BA108B3BD441BD5F",
      "text": "答案揭曉。圓陸鯊前輩的頭上\\n之所以會閃耀著雪花結晶，\\r\\n是因為牠變成了冰屬性。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_12",
      "hash64": "BA108C3BD441BF12",
      "text": "由於圓陸鯊前輩現在是冰屬性……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "BA108D3BD441C0C5",
      "text": "平時會對牠造成４倍傷害的冰屬性招式，\\n現在對牠會是效果不好的呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "BA10863BD441B4E0",
      "text": "對了，說到雪花結晶，\\n雖然它有很多種形狀，\\r\\n但幾乎都可以被歸類為六角形。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "BA10873BD441B693",
      "text": "並沒有人設下規定，但雪花卻會\\n以同樣的形狀在冬天翩翩落下。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "BA10883BD441B846",
      "text": "各位同學是不是也能\\n感受到大自然的神秘呢？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "BA10893BD441B9F9",
      "text": "……咳咳！\\c\\n雖然沒什麼關連性，\\n但吉尼亞老師的眼鏡也是六角形的呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_18",
      "hash64": "BA10923BD441C944",
      "text": "另外，差點忘記告訴各位了。\\n如果想改變寶可夢的太晶屬性，\\r\\n可以到錦匯鎮的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]寶食堂[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]變更。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_19",
      "hash64": "BA10933BD441CAF7",
      "text": "食堂的大廚是個難搞的人，\\n得要先獲得她的好感才行是也……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_03_dragon_20",
      "hash64": "BA1A9C3BD44A2EC7",
      "text": "好了，\\n下一堂課要考期中考喔！\\r\\n也謝謝你了，圓陸鯊前輩。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_f_03_poke_03",
      "hash64": "71F13D9D9AB60E0E",
      "text": "閃嚕……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
